flowchart TD
    A[Requested action] --> B[Validate bounded inputs]
    B -->|Valid| C[Call least privilege tool]
    B -->|Invalid| D[Stop and request clarification]
    C --> E{Tool result}
    E -->|Success| F[Check output shape and scope]
    E -->|Error| G[Classify error]
    G -->|Retryable| H[Verify state before retry]
    G -->|Not retryable| I[Report failure and stop]
    F --> J[Record side effect and operation result]